Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add local Bigscreen channel control

Expose acknowledged local channel browsing, selection and player commands for the native Home Assistant bridge. Keep automation identities separate from legacy guide keys and exclude credentials and ambiguous M3U entries. Reuse the existing Qt player and timeshift recorder, guard against duplicate UI instances and test delayed catalogue readiness.
